 	Let $k$ be an odd integer and $\{e_i\}_{i=1}^k$ a self-dual normal basis of
 	$\F_{2^k}$ over $\F_2$. Then $\tr(e_i) = 1$ for all $i$, and the
 	representation $\kappa(1)$ of the unit $1 \in \F_{2^k}$ is the all-ones
